@startuml

title The ImagesAnnotator dependencies

package "The application" #FFFFFF {
  component "ImagesAnnotator" as APP
  component "GUI toolkit\nGTKmm3 | GTKmm4 | Qt6 | wxWidgets" as GUI
}

package "The ImagesAnnotator libraries" #F4F4F4 {
  component "ImagesAnnotator-DataExporters\nImagesAnnotatorDataExporters011" as IADE
  component "ImagesAnnotator-DataImporters\nImagesAnnotatorDataImporters013" as IADI
  component "ImagesAnnotator-DataDrivers\nImagesAnnotatorDataDrivers011" as IADD
}

package "Third party" #EEEEEE {
  component "libcurl" as CURL
  component "nlohmann/json" as NJSON
  component "OpenCV\ncore, imgcodecs" as OCV
  component "GoogleTest / GoogleMock" as GTEST
}

note right of APP
  The annotator business logic, the events bus
  and four interchangeable GUI implementations.
  Exactly one toolkit is compiled in, picked at
  the configure time by the mutually exclusive
  USE_GTKMM3 / USE_GTKMM4 / USE_QT6 /
  USE_WXWIDGETS options.
end note

note bottom of IADE
  Writes nine dataset layouts out of a project.
  Declares IImageCropperFacility, and ships an
  OpenCV cropper of its own when the build
  found OpenCV.
end note

note bottom of IADI
  Reads three dataset layouts back into a
  project. Declares IImageSizeFacility, and
  ships an OpenCV size reader of its own when
  the build found OpenCV.
end note

note bottom of IADD
  The project JSON database - the parsing, the
  merging and the storing - and the ImageRecord
  / ImageRecordRect value types the other two
  are written in terms of.
end note

APP --> GUI : compiles one of
APP --> IADE : export requests
APP --> IADI : import requests
APP --> IADD : opens and stores the project
APP --> CURL : loads web hosted images

GUI ..> IADE : implements\nIImageCropperFacility
GUI ..> IADI : implements\nIImageSizeFacility

IADE --> IADD : PUBLIC
IADI --> IADD : PUBLIC

IADE --> CURL : PRIVATE
IADE ..> OCV : PRIVATE, optional
IADI ..> OCV : PRIVATE, optional

IADD --> NJSON : PRIVATE
IADD --> CURL : PRIVATE, the CURLU URL API only

APP ..> GTEST : tests only
IADE ..> GTEST : tests only
IADI ..> GTEST : tests only
IADD ..> GTEST : tests only

legend bottom
  The three ImagesAnnotator libraries are consumed installed: none of them is
  fetched by a configure of this project, and none is a distribution package.
  misc/ci/install-annotator-libraries.sh builds and installs all three.
  A PUBLIC link is one whose usage requirements reach this project as well -
  the installable headers of both sibling libraries name the data drivers types.
end legend

@enduml
